    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "gym_mushi_010_receptionist_01",
      "hash64": "12BB275357DBC9ED",
      "text": "歡迎光臨圓模道館！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "gym_mushi_010_receptionist_02",
      "hash64": "12BB245357DBC4D4",
      "text": "請讓我登記\\n挑戰者的名字……\\r\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳是[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，對吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "gym_mushi_010_receptionist_03",
      "hash64": "12BB255357DBC687",
      "text": "想和本道館的館主阿楓對戰，\\n就必須先通過道館測驗。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "gym_mushi_010_receptionist_04",
      "hash64": "12BB225357DBC16E",
      "text": "圓模道館的道館測驗是……\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]滾橄欖[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "gym_mushi_010_receptionist_history",
      "hash64": "1D34FC39E3AF567A",
      "text": "在橄欖的產地圓模，\\n自古就會舉辦祈求豐收的\\r\\n橄欖豐收祭。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "gym_mushi_010_receptionist_05",
      "hash64": "12BB235357DBC321",
      "text": "將仿照橄欖形狀製作的球一路滾到終點，\\n就算通過道館測驗了。\\r\\n明年能夠採收到很多橄欖喔！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "gym_mushi_010_receptionist_06",
      "hash64": "12BB205357DBBE08",
      "text": "詳細規則請洽詢\\n在會場的工作人員。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "gym_mushi_010_receptionist_map",
      "hash64": "DFC4229CB253ADF4",
      "text": "滾橄欖的會場就在\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]圓模鎮的北邊[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]！\\r\\n我幫[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳把位置登錄到地圖上吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
